WEBVTT

00:35.950 --> 00:37.770
It's finally the day of the battle.

00:38.270 --> 00:39.810
Oh, Usato-kun!

00:39.810 --> 00:41.810
You're wearing matching
outfits with Rose-san!

00:42.290 --> 00:43.690
Inukami-senpai!

00:43.690 --> 00:46.360
What's up?
You're up early.

00:46.360 --> 00:49.490
Just going on one of
those morning walks.

00:49.990 --> 00:51.070
More importantly...

00:52.490 --> 00:54.740
what do you think of this armor?

00:55.090 --> 00:57.450
I'm not sure what you want me to say...

00:57.450 --> 00:59.000
It's pretty, isn't it?

00:59.000 --> 01:01.250
But that's not all there is to it!

01:01.250 --> 01:03.460
You wanna know more, don't you?

01:03.460 --> 01:04.959
Of course, you do!

01:04.959 --> 01:05.920
Sure...

01:06.310 --> 01:11.680
This armor boosts my lightning magic!

01:12.260 --> 01:15.260
It also doesn't hinder my movement!

01:15.560 --> 01:17.890
Check out the joints on this thing!

01:17.890 --> 01:20.140
You sure
are happy...

01:20.140 --> 01:24.310
So, you prefer armor
over cute stuff...?

01:24.310 --> 01:25.690
Not at all!

01:26.150 --> 01:30.490
Back home,
I used to cultivate cactuses to relax.

01:30.490 --> 01:34.620
I don't know whether
I'd call cactuses cute...

01:34.970 --> 01:38.870
Then, why don't you become
my source of comfort?

01:39.570 --> 01:40.960
What's with that leap in logic?

01:40.960 --> 01:42.590
I've already lost you!

01:42.590 --> 01:44.580
You need to be true
to yourself, Usato-kun!

01:44.580 --> 01:46.670
I know the truth!

01:46.670 --> 01:48.460
That's just you hiding your feelings.

01:48.460 --> 01:50.300
In other words, your "tsun"!

01:50.300 --> 01:52.800
S-Senpai, please calm down!

01:53.180 --> 01:55.930
Where there's a "tsun,"
there's always a "dere"!

01:55.930 --> 01:59.470
I want to create a situation
where you're all "dere"!

01:59.830 --> 02:01.390
Come! Let's get along!

02:01.390 --> 02:03.310
S-Stop!

02:03.310 --> 02:05.730
Humans are creatures of communication!

02:05.730 --> 02:07.270
Let's use our words!

02:07.270 --> 02:10.650
There are times when actions
speak louder than words!

02:10.650 --> 02:12.450
This is one of those times!

02:12.450 --> 02:15.870
K-Kazuki! Save me!

02:15.870 --> 02:18.030
Senpai, what are you doing?!

02:18.330 --> 02:19.940
He really came?!

02:19.940 --> 02:21.700
Don't stop me, Kazuki-kun!

02:21.700 --> 02:25.000
Siglis-san is calling for us, let's go!

02:25.500 --> 02:28.170
I'll go once I make Usato-kun mine!

02:28.170 --> 02:30.470
Get her out of here right now, Kazuki!

02:30.470 --> 02:31.630
You got it, Usato!

02:32.040 --> 02:34.300
I'll be back, Usato-kun!

02:34.300 --> 02:36.970
I'll have you comfort me yet!

02:38.180 --> 02:39.760
See ya, Usato!

02:40.170 --> 02:42.050
Thanks, Kazuki!

03:03.580 --> 03:08.250
THE WRONG WAY TO USE HEALING MAGIC

04:18.990 --> 04:20.029
#10 MADNESS?! THE BLACK KNIGHT APPEARS!

04:20.029 --> 04:22.029
#10 MADNESS?! THE BLACK KNIGHT APPEARS!
According to our scouts,

04:22.029 --> 04:26.250
it will be another half hour before
the Demon Lord's Army arrives.

04:26.250 --> 04:28.750
When they do, we will launch
a preemptive strike...

04:28.750 --> 04:31.000
with a barrage of magic.

04:32.000 --> 04:35.590
After that,
you two will engage the enemy.

04:35.590 --> 04:39.510
Together with the other knights, you will
carve open a path to the enemy general.

04:40.000 --> 04:41.600
And, if possible...

04:42.260 --> 04:43.890
take that general down!

04:44.560 --> 04:45.560
Understood.

04:46.000 --> 04:49.850
We will bring Lloyd-sama good news back!

04:49.850 --> 04:50.730
Roger!

04:53.810 --> 04:56.110
Don't push yourself too hard, Kazuki-kun.

04:56.570 --> 04:57.820
I'll be fine.

04:57.820 --> 04:59.970
You don't have to worry about me.

05:00.490 --> 05:02.570
What about you, Senpai?

05:02.570 --> 05:04.000
Aren't you worried?

05:05.120 --> 05:08.450
Enough to distract yourself with Usato?

05:10.040 --> 05:13.290
You're sharp when it comes
to others, huh?

05:13.290 --> 05:15.960
I am worried.

05:15.960 --> 05:20.300
But to tell you the truth,
I feel kind of empowered.

05:21.470 --> 05:25.510
That's way different from
back in our old world.

05:26.170 --> 05:30.100
Yup. That old me is gone.

05:30.560 --> 05:34.720
But Usato-kun accepts me
for who I am now.

05:40.650 --> 05:43.860
I didn't know that!
Tell me more!

05:45.280 --> 05:48.660
Not now. I'll tell you
if we make it back safe.

05:49.330 --> 05:51.580
If we make it, huh?

05:52.870 --> 05:56.000
We've got to make it back now.

06:02.590 --> 06:03.590
Senpai.

06:04.890 --> 06:07.110
I feel it, too.

06:07.670 --> 06:08.470
They're here.

06:15.060 --> 06:16.440
Ready your magic!

06:16.980 --> 06:19.230
We're making the first move.

06:19.230 --> 06:20.030
You ready?

06:20.610 --> 06:22.070
Of course!

06:22.740 --> 06:24.360
We've got no choice, after all!

06:30.120 --> 06:31.210
Fire!

06:36.630 --> 06:37.790
All right!

06:42.010 --> 06:42.880
That was...

06:43.290 --> 06:44.410
an illusion?!

06:45.470 --> 06:46.800
Where is the real army?

06:47.300 --> 06:48.550
Illusion magic.

06:49.870 --> 06:51.390
They're to the southwest!

06:53.730 --> 06:55.350
Let's go, Kazuki-kun!

06:55.350 --> 06:56.230
Right!

06:59.400 --> 07:00.320
Tong.

07:00.860 --> 07:01.780
Alec.

07:02.280 --> 07:03.240
Mill.

07:03.780 --> 07:04.700
Gomul.

07:05.240 --> 07:06.160
Gurd.

07:06.830 --> 07:08.820
You guys head out
onto the battlefield.

07:08.820 --> 07:11.370
Bring anyone you find
who's injured back here.

07:11.370 --> 07:12.080
Yes, ma'am!

07:12.500 --> 07:13.120
Go!

07:13.710 --> 07:15.290
And make sure to make it back alive!

07:15.640 --> 07:16.710
Roger!

07:17.750 --> 07:19.250
Orga, Ururu.

07:19.250 --> 07:21.880
The two of you will be
stationed in this tent.

07:22.290 --> 07:24.270
Aruku will act as your guard.

07:25.510 --> 07:28.340
But, if anything happens,
make a run for it.

07:28.730 --> 07:29.470
Got it!

07:29.830 --> 07:34.180
You and I will head out onto
the battlefield after some time.

07:34.180 --> 07:36.440
In the meantime,
we'll heal the wounded here.

07:36.440 --> 07:37.480
Understood.

07:37.810 --> 07:39.900
Everyone, to your stations!

07:42.400 --> 07:43.980
Senpai and Kazuki...

07:43.980 --> 07:45.320
I wonder if they'll be fine.

07:45.320 --> 07:47.070
Worried about your friends?

07:47.070 --> 07:48.530
O-Of course.

07:48.530 --> 07:52.280
But you'll be heading out as well.

07:52.280 --> 07:53.490
You need to take care, too.

07:53.490 --> 07:54.700
Right.

07:55.040 --> 07:56.460
Here they come!

07:56.460 --> 07:57.830
Already?!

07:57.830 --> 08:00.840
This is war.
They'll keep coming.

08:00.840 --> 08:02.500
Get to healing, now!

08:02.830 --> 08:03.920
R-Right away!

08:10.720 --> 08:11.680
This is bad!

08:17.060 --> 08:19.480
I'm sorry, I'll heal you right away!

08:23.320 --> 08:24.780
A... snake...

08:25.860 --> 08:29.660
A big snake... blew me away.

08:31.280 --> 08:32.200
Could it be...

08:32.700 --> 08:33.990
related to that one?

08:36.039 --> 08:38.330
Gotta focus on healing first!

08:41.210 --> 08:43.919
Damn demons! I can't believe
they have a giant snake!

08:44.210 --> 08:46.710
Don't let your guard down!
It's venomous!

08:46.710 --> 08:48.340
Then, what can we—

08:49.680 --> 08:52.260
Guess that's all humans are capable of.

08:52.680 --> 08:55.600
I didn't even need to come...

09:02.020 --> 09:03.020
I got him!

09:14.910 --> 09:16.450
B-But how?

09:16.870 --> 09:20.210
Humans really are weak...

09:20.210 --> 09:21.370
It's sad, really...

09:21.720 --> 09:23.960
What... happened?

09:23.960 --> 09:26.090
What... are you?

09:28.090 --> 09:29.590
I wonder...

09:29.590 --> 09:30.970
What am I?

09:34.680 --> 09:36.930
I have to tell them!

09:36.930 --> 09:39.560
Tell them about this...!

09:39.980 --> 09:43.230
You're tenacious,
I grant you that.

09:43.230 --> 09:44.730
But I grow tired of you.

09:45.690 --> 09:46.650
So, die.

09:51.490 --> 09:52.030
What?

09:52.030 --> 09:54.570
That's my special stinky water!

09:56.080 --> 09:57.450
What was that about?

09:59.080 --> 10:01.790
There are some troublesome
pests on the human side.

10:02.250 --> 10:03.540
The Kidnappers.

10:04.210 --> 10:05.580
I see!

10:05.580 --> 10:07.630
So, those are the Kidnappers!

10:11.340 --> 10:13.090
Well played, humans!

10:13.090 --> 10:15.800
Keep making this fun for me!

10:21.430 --> 10:23.600
What's going on over there?

10:25.230 --> 10:27.900
This one's serious!
Best treat him quick!

10:28.240 --> 10:29.320
Put him over here!

10:31.690 --> 10:33.110
It's about time.

10:34.340 --> 10:35.490
Usato...

10:35.490 --> 10:37.410
you ready?

10:38.740 --> 10:40.240
Of course.

10:40.830 --> 10:44.210
You've trained me
to be your right-hand man.

10:44.670 --> 10:45.580
I see.

10:45.580 --> 10:47.380
Guess I won't have to worry.

10:47.750 --> 10:50.050
You were worried?

10:50.050 --> 10:51.920
That's a surprise.

10:51.920 --> 10:53.920
You don't know when to shut up.

10:54.550 --> 10:56.800
Orga, Ururu,
I leave this place to you guys.

10:57.300 --> 11:00.970
Roger! Go heal up a storm!

11:00.970 --> 11:02.640
Stay safe, all right?

11:02.970 --> 11:03.600
You got it!

11:03.600 --> 11:04.600
Here we go!

11:06.940 --> 11:08.650
Take care of those two.

11:08.650 --> 11:09.570
Of course.

11:09.570 --> 11:11.030
You bet I will.

11:14.320 --> 11:15.320
Let's go.

11:21.240 --> 11:23.790
I heard something concerning from Alec.

11:23.790 --> 11:24.410
Yeah?

11:24.710 --> 11:26.790
There's an enemy in black armor.

11:26.790 --> 11:29.170
According to a knight
who got taken down by him,

11:29.170 --> 11:31.170
he uses a peculiar kind of magic.

11:31.170 --> 11:32.090
Be careful.

11:33.210 --> 11:35.010
Black armor?

11:45.940 --> 11:46.810
What's up?

11:46.810 --> 11:47.900
N-nothing.

11:49.020 --> 11:51.770
Here's one final piece of advice for you.

11:52.780 --> 11:55.650
You can't kill anyone, can you?

11:56.060 --> 12:00.160
My role is... to save lives.

12:00.570 --> 12:06.080
You have to be a real idiot
to say that in the face of death.

12:07.580 --> 12:12.130
I've got a special technique
for idiots like you.

12:13.130 --> 12:16.840
Listen up because I'm only
going to say this once.

12:17.590 --> 12:20.930
If you face an enemy you have to
defeat no matter what...

12:24.970 --> 12:27.850
That really is
the best technique ever.

12:27.850 --> 12:30.940
Did you think that up
especially for me?

12:30.940 --> 12:32.110
Not on your life.

12:32.820 --> 12:34.020
Thank you.

12:34.690 --> 12:35.390
No problem.

12:35.940 --> 12:39.200
You go right, I go left.

12:40.280 --> 12:42.120
Yes, Captain!

13:00.130 --> 13:02.140
This is the battlefield.

13:06.220 --> 13:07.890
Die!

13:12.600 --> 13:15.480
You're one of those healers, huh?

13:24.160 --> 13:25.580
Come on, come on!

13:25.580 --> 13:27.660
Get outta my way!!!

13:30.910 --> 13:32.080
She flew!

13:36.670 --> 13:37.880
Y-You are?

13:38.260 --> 13:40.800
I healed you while I was carrying you.

13:40.800 --> 13:42.510
Take a little rest,

13:42.510 --> 13:45.930
and if you're still not feeling well,
please withdraw from the front lines.

13:51.060 --> 13:53.310
Thank you very much, Madam Hero!

13:53.310 --> 13:56.310
We've managed to clear out
most of the surrounding enemies.

13:56.770 --> 13:59.610
Commander, have anyone
injured withdraw at once!

14:00.740 --> 14:01.860
I'm going ahead!

14:01.860 --> 14:02.860
Yes, ma'am!

14:09.500 --> 14:11.790
Senpai, are you all right?

14:13.000 --> 14:14.500
Of course!

14:14.500 --> 14:16.790
Their base is still quite a way away.

14:16.790 --> 14:18.590
We don't have time to dally!

14:20.010 --> 14:23.050
I heard they have a rather
pesky snake monster.

14:23.050 --> 14:23.760
Yeah...

14:24.180 --> 14:27.970
But we have to clear a path
to the enemy general.

14:30.220 --> 14:31.100
I know.

14:31.100 --> 14:34.250
Let's do our job and kill that snake, too.

14:35.060 --> 14:35.980
Let's.

14:35.980 --> 14:37.610
Come on, everyone!

14:50.450 --> 14:51.870
I found you!

14:52.500 --> 14:54.790
What... is that?

14:55.460 --> 14:56.750
I don't know,

14:56.750 --> 15:00.650
but that guy's unlike any of
the soldiers we fought before!

15:02.010 --> 15:03.340
Stay back, everyone!

15:04.300 --> 15:06.090
Stop! Come back!

15:10.680 --> 15:12.790
Take this!

15:15.730 --> 15:18.020
Why is he not resisting?

15:18.940 --> 15:21.690
He... doesn't feel pain?

15:24.280 --> 15:26.780
You're in the way, pests.

15:32.830 --> 15:35.370
Fall back at once! Quickly!

15:45.010 --> 15:47.180
What... did you do?!

15:47.180 --> 15:48.260
Don't!

15:50.600 --> 15:52.560
Oh, light magic?!

15:52.560 --> 15:54.100
That's a first for me!

15:54.460 --> 15:56.600
Why'd you stop me, Senpai?!

15:56.600 --> 15:59.980
You mustn't land a direct hit on him.

15:59.980 --> 16:02.020
If I'm correct, his magic is...

16:02.480 --> 16:03.440
Reflect.

16:06.450 --> 16:07.530
Kazuki-kun!

16:10.200 --> 16:11.620
What happened?

16:11.620 --> 16:13.200
Under his armor?

16:13.200 --> 16:15.750
Kazuki-kun, are you okay?

16:15.750 --> 16:18.290
I'm fine. It's just a scratch.

16:19.630 --> 16:20.280
But...

16:21.290 --> 16:23.300
thanks to your rashness...

16:23.300 --> 16:24.880
I've figured it out.

16:24.880 --> 16:26.550
His magic.

16:26.990 --> 16:31.970
It reflects all damage dealt to his armor
right back onto his opponents.

16:33.680 --> 16:35.390
Oh? You're a clever one.

16:35.390 --> 16:38.060
No one's figured it out
so quickly before.

16:38.940 --> 16:40.940
Don't run on me now.

16:40.940 --> 16:44.020
You guys seem strong for humans.

16:44.020 --> 16:48.320
Struggle, struggle, struggle,
and then die!

16:59.410 --> 17:02.330
Damn it! What's this?

17:03.210 --> 17:05.050
Healing magic doesn't work on it.

17:06.380 --> 17:09.300
Did something happen
to Senpai and Kazuki?

17:09.300 --> 17:10.720
Die!

17:17.140 --> 17:19.520
You're mine!

17:23.150 --> 17:24.270
Are you all right?

17:26.480 --> 17:28.069
You're the guy I healed just now!

17:31.780 --> 17:34.220
Yeah, thanks for that!

17:34.990 --> 17:36.410
No, it's nothing.

17:37.040 --> 17:38.660
Er, do you know where Inu...

17:38.660 --> 17:40.040
I mean...

17:40.040 --> 17:42.330
do you know where the Heroes are?

17:43.330 --> 17:44.500
The Heroes?

17:44.500 --> 17:46.920
They're right
in the middle of the front lines.

17:49.230 --> 17:50.500
Thank you very much.

17:52.050 --> 17:53.010
Take care!

17:53.550 --> 17:54.550
Please...

17:54.550 --> 17:55.930
still be alive!

18:00.680 --> 18:01.640
That's right.

18:01.640 --> 18:03.940
You guys take on those weaklings.

18:04.350 --> 18:07.770
Kazuki-kun, let's take out
the Black Knight

18:07.770 --> 18:09.480
while the others are being distracted.

18:09.480 --> 18:10.820
But how?

18:11.280 --> 18:15.780
If he can reflect any attack,
there's nothing we can do.

18:16.200 --> 18:17.870
It might be dangerous,

18:17.870 --> 18:19.450
but there's something I want to try.

18:20.830 --> 18:21.870
Oh?

18:21.870 --> 18:24.120
What do you guys have in mind?

18:26.040 --> 18:28.590
Senpai, it's way too dangerous!

18:28.590 --> 18:29.710
You scared?

18:29.710 --> 18:32.670
At worst, we have Usato to heal us!

18:35.590 --> 18:39.010
I'm already used to your
foolhardiness from back home.

18:41.190 --> 18:43.100
You ready?

18:43.100 --> 18:44.980
Then, let's dance!

18:45.770 --> 18:47.190
Let's go, Kazuki-kun!

18:47.190 --> 18:47.810
You got it!

18:54.740 --> 18:56.660
We've obstructed his vision!

19:08.340 --> 19:09.340
Did that work?

19:10.300 --> 19:11.590
Reflect.

19:19.390 --> 19:24.100
I had hoped he wouldn't be able
to reflect attacks he couldn't see.

19:24.100 --> 19:25.450
I was hoping for too much.

19:26.850 --> 19:28.890
The attack on his back...

19:29.400 --> 19:30.690
wasn't reflected!

19:33.900 --> 19:36.530
Kazuki-kun, let's try that one more time!

19:36.530 --> 19:37.030
Wha?

19:40.080 --> 19:41.030
Very well!

19:41.390 --> 19:45.410
Show me something more
interesting this time, okay?

20:03.140 --> 20:04.520
I know exactly...

20:05.100 --> 20:06.890
what you have in mind.

20:13.190 --> 20:15.530
That's all you've got?

20:15.850 --> 20:18.860
Trying to blind me again?
How boring.

20:32.130 --> 20:34.630
The attack isn't being reflected.

20:35.210 --> 20:36.260
As I suspected.

20:36.260 --> 20:38.680
He can't reflect attacks
he can't perceive.

20:40.390 --> 20:42.850
And now that he can't speak...

20:43.160 --> 20:45.970
Your attack should work now, Kazuki-kun!

20:50.940 --> 20:52.110
Just kidding!

20:55.690 --> 20:56.780
Reflect.

21:12.330 --> 21:13.880
K-Kazuki-kun...

21:15.140 --> 21:19.220
Attacks he can't perceive
aren't reflected right away.

21:19.550 --> 21:24.180
So, all we need to do is to make him
unable to say "reflect" with an attack.

21:24.180 --> 21:25.430
Is that what you thought?

21:26.520 --> 21:31.060
It has nothing to do with
my vision or my perception.

21:31.440 --> 21:32.600
It's not automatic.

21:32.600 --> 21:34.730
I decide what attacks to reflect.

21:35.070 --> 21:39.440
I purposely didn't reflect
the attack on my back.

21:39.440 --> 21:42.490
I don't even need to say
"reflect" for it to work.

21:43.620 --> 21:46.910
No one has ever injured me...

21:47.620 --> 21:48.750
and no one ever will.

22:04.390 --> 22:06.550
Usato-kun...

22:06.550 --> 22:09.060
I'm... sorry.
